arent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":403.70098876953125,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":361.6666666666667,"r":386.3333333333333,"t":410.3676554361979},"charspan":[0,6],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/43","text":"FRANCE"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"PORTU","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":373.70098876953125,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":304.3333333333333,"r":317.6666666666667,"t":379.0343221028646},"charspan":[0,5],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/44","text":"PORTU"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"MALTA","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":336.3676554361979,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":427.0,"r":437.0,"t":340.3676554361979},"charspan":[0,5],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/45","text":"MALTA"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"(i) The strictest category prescribes the opt-in mechanism - i.e., the user must provide consent. The consent must be obtained before cookies are used. This interpretation is in force in 11 EU MSs.","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":180.3140191695312,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":296.495,"r":534.5447560839868,"t":227.7024308695312},"charspan":[0,197],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/46","text":"(i) The strictest category prescribes the opt-in mechanism - i.e., the user must provide consent. The consent must be obtained before cookies are used. This interpretation is in force in 11 EU MSs."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"(ii) More flexible interpretations allow the consent to be implied - i.e., inferred from the behavior of the user. In other words, consent can be conveyed by clicking a link or scrolling through a website. In 9 MSs, regulations allow implied consent.","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":115.3140191695312,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":296.495,"r":533.1671234559713,"t":175.7024308695312},"charspan":[0,250],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/47","text":"(ii) More flexible interpretations allow the consent to be implied - i.e., inferred from the behavior of the user. In other words, consent can be conveyed by clicking a link or scrolling through a website. In 9 MSs, regulations allow implied consent."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"(iii) Tolerant interpretations of the ePrivacy Directive do not require consent. The website must show a Cookie Bar warning users about the use of cookies, that can","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":76.3140191695312,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":296.495,"r":532.9163258679737,"t":110.70243086953121},"charspan":[0,164],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/48","text":"(iii) Tolerant interpretations of the ePrivacy Directive do not require consent. The website must show a Cookie Bar warning users about the use of cookies, that can"}],"version":"1.10.0"}